    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any mountains.\n\nNightspire is a midnight-blue vine that climbs exposed rock faces towards the highest available point. Its tiny star-shaped flowers open during storms and carry the clean scent of rain even after months of drying. Monastic herbalists wind the vine into a ring and steep it whole, producing a dark infusion that leaves the drinker calm, watchful and slightly distant. For 1 hour, you gain a +1-item bonus to Will saving throws.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
